+- Dev: `npm run dev` / `npm run dev:3001`
+- Build: `npm run build`
+- Start: `npm run start`
+- Lint: `npm run lint`
+- Unit tests: `npm run test:unit`
+- API smoke: `npm run smoke:api`
+- Local API smoke (starts server if needed): `npm run smoke:api:local`
